<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id" />
  <para style="h">RUTH</para>
  <para style="toc1">Buk pa Ruth</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ruth</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rut</para>
  <para style="mt2">Buk pa</para>
  <para style="mt1">RUTH</para>
  <para style="imt">Lanyut wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="ip">Lok man me kuc ma ododo pa Ruth keloni otiine ikare ma tim me gero, bwami ki tic me alany ki aranyi onongo oromo i lobo Icrael woko ducu, kit ma buk pa Lungolkop otito kwedeni.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ruth ma anyira Moab ceng en ogero awobi mo ma i ot pa Elimelek, laco ma nyinge Malon ma gin obedo jo Icrael me Eparata matye i gangi me Beterekem i Juda.</para>
  <para style="ip">Inge to pa cware, Ruth onyutu mar madit tutwal ikom daane. Omiyo gudwogo cen kwede i lobo Icrael nia ki i lobo Moab. Gin aryonu guo ikare ma kikayo cayiri, ki dok en Ruth bene obedo kiworo madit ikom Lubanga pa Icrael kun omaro mada. Ci oweko en otiyo bote keken. Ma oweko woro lubanga pa kwarogi me Moab.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pi mar ki gen ma en oketo ikom lupacoge omiyo daane olego Lubanga ni omyero onong laco ikin jo pacoge, ci en dok ogero laco mo ikin wat macok i pacoge. Pi nyom meno en aye Ruth odoko iye dayo madit pa Daudi, ma en laco madit ma oywek pi bedo laloc maber i lobo Icrael.</para>
  <para style="ip">I pwony mapatpat matye i buk pa Lungolkop, waneno kit kwayi peko ki aroma ma dano poto iye pi kwero loke onyo dwogo cen kaworo Rwot Lubanga. Ento i ododo pa Ruth waneno gum ma dano limo pi bino kaworo ki tic bot Rwot. Kun en pe paro ni in ibedo dano me Icrael ma gin aye jo me gicikene onyo larokgu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Lacim wilok madito ma i buk man</para>
  <para style="io1">Naomi gudwogo i Beterekem gin ki ciwode Ruth <char style="ior"><ref loc="RUT 1:1-22">1:1-22</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Rwate pa Ruth gin ki Boaj <char style="ior"><ref loc="RUT 2:1-3:18">2:1—3:18</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">Kit ma Boaj onyomo kwede Ruth <char style="ior"><ref loc="RUT 4:1-22">4:1-22</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="RUT 1" />
  <para style="s1">Elimelek ki jo ma i ode gudak i lobo Moab</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 1:1" />Ikare ca ma lungolkop aye giloyo lobo Icrael, kec opoto i lobo malit. Ci laco mo me Beterekem ma i Juda ocito i lobo Moab wek ebed kunu pi tutunu, en ki dakone ki awobegi aryo. <verse eid="RUT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 1:2" />Nying laconu Elimelek, ki nying dakone Naomi; nying awobegi aryoni en aye Malon ki Kilion. Yam gin jo Eprata me Beterekem ma i Juda. Gucito i lobo Moab kama, gugony iye. <verse eid="RUT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 1:3" />Ka Elimelek ma cwar Naomi oto woko, ci nen en odong ki awobene aryonu. <verse eid="RUT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 1:4" />Gin ducu gunyomo anyira Moab; nying ngat acel kilwongo ni Orupa ki nying mukene ca Ruth. Gubedo kunu pi kine maromo mwaka apar; <verse eid="RUT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 1:5" />ka lacen Malon ki Kilion bene guto woko, gin aryo ducu, ci man omiyo dako odong kene labongo cware ki awobene aryonu.<verse eid="RUT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Naomi odwogo cen i Beterekem gin ki Ruth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 1:6" />Ka Naomi owinyo ki i lobo Moab ni Rwot dong otyeko limo jone kun omiyogi cam, ci en ocako a woko ki kunu me dok cen ki mon pa awobene aryonu ducu. <verse eid="RUT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 1:7" />Kitmeno gin gua woko ki i kabedo ma onongo gitye iyeni ki mon pa awobene, gucako wot me dok i lobo Juda. <verse eid="RUT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 1:8" />Ento Naomi owaco bot mon wote ni, “Wun wudok woko cen, ngat acel acel odok gire i ot pa mine. Rwot otimwu maber, kit ma wun bene wutimo an kacel ki jona ma wanggi dong orwenyo woko ki botani. <verse eid="RUT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 1:9" />Rwot omiwu wunong gang ger, wek ngat acel acel ikinwu obed gire i ot pa cware.” Ci Naomi onoto lemgi me cikogi, ci gucako kok matek.<verse eid="RUT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 1:10" />Ci guwace ni, “Pe kumeno; wan wabidok kwedi wa bot jowu.” <verse eid="RUT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 1:11" />Ento Naomi owaco botgi ni, “Bedo ber pirwu me dok cen anyirana, wubicito kweda pingo? Pud dok atwero nywalo lutino bo ma myero gudok cogwu? <verse eid="RUT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 1:12" />Wudok cen, anyirana, citu giwu, pien an dong atii woko, pe dok aromo bedo ki cwara mo, dok kono awaco ni, pud ageno ni atwero nywalo lutino, kadi abed ki cwara mo i dyewor man, kadi anywalo awobe, <verse eid="RUT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 1:13" />ci wun wuye kurugi nio ka gudongo mono? Wun kono wubikwero gero co? Pe kumeno, anyirana, pien arem cwiny ma atye kwede dwong mada makato mewu, pi kipwola ma Rwot omiyo opoto ikomani.”<verse eid="RUT 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 1:14" />Dok gucako kok matek ki dwon gi malongo; lacen Orupa onoto lem daane me cike kwede, ento Ruth ocere ikore matwal.<verse eid="RUT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 1:15" />Ci Naomi dok owaco bote ni, “Nen, nyeki otyeko dok cen bot lutugi ki bot lubangane; in bene idok cen ikor nyeki.” <verse eid="RUT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 1:16" />Ento Ruth odok i iye ni, “Pe ibed ka lega ni aweki, nyo ni adok cen awek lubu kori; pien kama in icito iye, an bene abicito iye; kama ibutu iye, an bene abibutu iye; jo tuwu gibibedo jo tuwa bene, dok Lubangani bibedo Lubangana. <verse eid="RUT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 1:17" />Kama ibito iye, an bene abito iye, ci kibiyika kunu. Myero Rwot oket can ikoma kitmeno ki makato bene, kace pe to kikome aye bipoko an kwedi.” <verse eid="RUT 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 1:18" />Ka Naomi oneno ni en otyeko moko tame me cito kwede, ci pe dong oloko gin mo.<verse eid="RUT 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 1:19" />Kitmeno mon aryonu gucako wot nio ka guo wa i Beterekem. Ka guo i Beterekem, ci mon ducu ma i taun gupong ki yomcwiny pirgi kun gipenye ni, “Man ada en aye Naomi?” <verse eid="RUT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 1:20" />Ci en owaco botgi ni. “Pe dok wulwongani Naomi, wulwonga ni Mara,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="fk">Mara </char> ki i leb Ibru: tereni Keckom nyo kipwola.</note> pien Won Twer Ducu okelo kipwola ikoma.” <verse eid="RUT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 1:21" />Yam acito ma abup, Rwot dong omiyo adwogo cen ma alam. Pingo wulwonga ni Naomi ma Rwot ouna kuman, ma Won Twer Ducu oketa i can mapek kuman?<verse eid="RUT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 1:22" />Kitmeno aye Naomi odwogo kwede cen kacel ki Ruth ma ciwode, nia ki i lobo Moab. Guo i Beterekem ikare ma kicako kayo cayiri.<verse eid="RUT 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="RUT 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ruth obeko cam i poto pa Boaj</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 2:1" />Naomi con tye ki wat ma ladogola pa cware, en dano ma lalonyo matye i dogola pa Elimelek, ma nyinge Boaj. <verse eid="RUT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:9-10">Lev 19:9-10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:19">Nwo 24:19</ref></char></note>Ruth ma anyira Moab owaco ki Naomi ni, “Wek acit i poto abek wit cayiri ki i kor dano mo ma biparo pira.” Ci en owaco ni, “Cit, nyara.” <verse eid="RUT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 2:3" />Ci Ruth ocito i poto kabeko kor lukac, ci ocob ikom poto pa Boaj ma ladogola pa Elimelek. <verse eid="RUT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 2:4" />Ci nen, Boaj oa ki i Beterekem, obino owaco ki lukac ni, “Rwot obed kwedwu.” Ci gudoke iye ni, “Rwot omii ki in gum.” <verse eid="RUT 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 2:5" />Boaj dok openyo latic maloyo lukac ni, “Man nya pa anga?” <verse eid="RUT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 2:6" />Ci latic maloyo lukac ogame ni, “Man nya jo Moab, mayam odwogo gin ki Naomi ki i lobo Moab. <verse eid="RUT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 2:7" />Ci en olega ni awek ebek korgi, kun ebeko ki ikin larita ma ikor lukac. Kitmeno en obino kun tiyo mede kwede nia wa odiko con nio wa onyo, kun pud peya oywe kadi matidi mo.”<verse eid="RUT 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 2:8" />Ci Boaj owaco ki Ruth ni, “Kong iwinya, nyara, pe dong icit ibek i poto mukene, nyo pe iwek poto man, ento bed katic kacel ki anyira ma gin lutic ma mera. <verse eid="RUT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 2:9" />Ket wangi ikom poto ma kitye ka kayoneni, wek ibed kalubu korgi. Dong atyeko ciko awobena ni pe gugud komi. Dok ka orwo pii neki, ci icit kama agulu pii tye iye, wek imat pii ma awobena gutwomoni.” <verse eid="RUT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 2:10" />Ci Ruth ogungo oryebe piny, kun wace ni, “Pingo luguma okaya inyimi, omiyo iparo pira ma an larok atani?” <verse eid="RUT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 2:11" />Ento Boaj ogamo doge ni, “Gin ducu ma ibedo katiyone pi daa ni nia ma cwari oto ca, kibedo katita woko ducu kikore, ki kit ma iweko kwede woru ki meni ki lobo tinoni pi bino i rok mayam pe ingeyo. <verse eid="RUT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 2:12" />Rwot aye myero ocul in pi gin madong itiyo maberi. Rwot ma en aye Lubanga pa jo Icrael kama iringo ilaro ite bwomeni, omiyi mot ma oromo maber!” <verse eid="RUT 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 2:13" />Ci Ruth ogamo ni, “Rwoda, in aye kica omaki ikoma, pien dong ityeko kweyo cwinya woko pi lok ki angecani lok me kica, kadi bed an pe a ngat acel ikom lwak angecani.”<verse eid="RUT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 2:14" />Ka kare me cam oromo ci Boaj dok owaco bote ni, “Bin kany, wek i cam kwon mo, i gwe ki dek.” Kitmeno Ruth ocako nywako bedo ki lukac, ci Boaj omiye cayiri ma kicelo acela. En ocamo nio ka oyeng, ci oweko mogo odong. <verse eid="RUT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 2:15" />Ka en oa malo kabeko cam, Boaj ociko awobene kun waco ni, “Wuwek en obek wa ikin larita, pe wule wiye. <verse eid="RUT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 2:16" />Dok bene wuwot wite mogo woko ki ikom larita, ci wuwek en obek, pe wucoke.”<verse eid="RUT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 2:17" />Kitmeno en obeko cam i poto nio wa otyeno, ci odino cayiri ma obekoni woko; omito romo debe aryo. <verse eid="RUT 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 2:18" />Ci otingo ocito kwede i taun, onyutu bot daane; ka dok okelo cam ma odong ma onongo en dong oyeng, omiyo ki daane. <verse eid="RUT 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 2:19" />Ci daane openye ni. “Tin ibeko ki kwene? Itiyo kwene? Gum obed ikom ngat ma oparo pirini.” Ci Ruth otito ki daane ngat ma etiyo boteni kun waco ni, “Nying dano ma tin atiyo boteni aye Boaj.” <verse eid="RUT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 2:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 25:25">Lev 25:25</ref></char></note>Ci Naomi owaco ki ciwode ni, “Myero Rwot omiye gum, Rwot ma kicane peya otenyo jo makwo ki jo ma otoni.” Dok Naomi owace ni, “Dano meno aye omegiwa dok en watwa macok tutwal.” <verse eid="RUT 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 2:21" />Ci Ruth ma anyira Moab owaco ni, “Medo ikom meno, dok en owaca bene ni, ‘In ibinywako bedo ki lutica nio ka gutyeko kayo kaca ducu.’” <verse eid="RUT 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 2:22" />Ci Naomi owaco ki ciwode Ruth ni, “Man ber nyara, ka ibicito kacel ki anyirane, wek pe dano gubed kagudu komi i poto mukene.” <verse eid="RUT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="RUT 2:23" />Kitmeno en obedo ki anyira pa Boaj kun beko cam nio ka kayo cayiri ki ngano otum, kun en obedo kacel ki daane.<verse eid="RUT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="RUT 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ruth ki Boaj i laro me dino ngano</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 3:1" />Naomi dok owaco ki Ruth ni, “Nyara, pe myero dong ayenyi laco, wek ibed maber? <verse eid="RUT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 3:2" />Boaj ma onongo ceng ibedo kakayo kac ki anyiraneni en aye ladogolawa. Nen ba, en tin bipyeto cayirine i otyeno i laro moyo. <verse eid="RUT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 3:3" />Ber in tin ilwoke, ci iwire ki moo, ka dong iruke ki bongini mabeconi, ci icit giri bote kunu wa i laro. Ento pe kong ikwong nyute keni bote nio ka otyeko cam ki matgu. <verse eid="RUT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 3:4" />Lacen ka dong obutu piny, ber in inen kama en obutu iye, ci icit, iel tung katyene, ibut iye; ci en bitito ki in gin ma ibitiyone.”<verse eid="RUT 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 3:5" />Ci Ruth ogamo dog daane ni, “Abitiyo gin ducu ma iwaco.”<verse eid="RUT 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 3:6" />Kitmeno Ruth ocako cito wa i laro moyo, ci otiyo kit ma daane otiteni kikome. <verse eid="RUT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 3:7" />Ka Boaj otyeko camo cam ki matgu, ma kun cwinye yom, ci ocito obutu kanget cayiri ma kiguro kacel. Ci Ruth okwale ocito mot, oelo tung tyene, ci obutu piny. <verse eid="RUT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 3:8" />Ka cawa oo kine i cwiny dyewor laco ocako po; ka oloke, ci nen onongo, dako mo obutu katyene. <verse eid="RUT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 3:9" />Ci openye ni, “In anga?” Ci en ogamo doge ni, “An a Ruth, angecani. Yar dog bongoni, wek iuma kwede, pien in aye imyero kalako an.” <verse eid="RUT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 3:10" />Ci en owace ni, “Rwot omii gum, nyara; man dok inyuta beri madit makato mayam itimo ikom daa ni, pien pe icito ikor awobe matino, ma lucan nyo ma lulonyo. <verse eid="RUT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 3:11" />Ci tin, nyara, pe dong ilwor, pien abitimo piri gin ducu ma ilegoni, pien lutuwa ma i taun kany gingeyo kit beri. <verse eid="RUT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 3:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 2:20">Rut 2:20</ref></char></note>Me ada an kono aye a watwu macok, ento tye omegiwa ma dok cok makato an maromo lako in. <verse eid="RUT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 3:13" />Kong ibut i dyewor man, ci diki odiko wabiniang kace omegiwa mukene ca aye bilaki, ci wek en olaki; ento ka omegiwa mukeneni pe mito laki, macalo Rwot tye makwoni, ci an ki koma abilaki ma ka en. Dong ibut piny nio wa odiko.”<verse eid="RUT 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 3:14" />Ci en obutu piny katyene nio wa odiko, ento oa woko con kwarpiny; pien Boaj omitoni pe ngat mo oniang ni dako man obino wa i laro moyo bote. <verse eid="RUT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 3:15" />Ci owace ni, “Kel bongo ma irukuni, iyar iye.” Ci en oyaro iye, ci Boaj opimo cayiri agwata moko maromo abicel, ocibo iwiye, ci en ocito kwede i taun. <verse eid="RUT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 3:16" />Ka Ruth oo gang, ci daane ocako penye ni, “Woti obedo ningning, nyara?” Ci Ruth otite gin ducu ma laco man Boaj otimo ikome, <verse eid="RUT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 3:17" />kun waco ni, “En omiya cayiri agwata moko maromo abicel kun waco ni, ‘Pe myero idok bot daa ni ki cingi nono.’” <verse eid="RUT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 3:18" />Ci daane odok iye ni, “Nyara, kong ikur nio ka iniang kit ma lok man tum kwede.” Pien angeyoni laco man pe biling mot, ento nio ka bityeko lok man woko tini.<verse eid="RUT 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="RUT 4" />
  <para style="s1">Boaj olako Ruth</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 4:1" />Ka Boaj ocito i dogcel me taun meno, ci obedo piny i iye kunu. Ci nen, lalako ma Boaj oloko pireni obino tye kawot ma mito kato akata. Ci Boaj owaco bote ni, “Bin, omera, ibed piny kany,” ci en obino obedo piny. <verse eid="RUT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 4:2" />Ci Boaj dok okwanyo ludongo me taun meno apar, ci owaco botgi ni, “Wubed piny kany,” ci gubedo piny. <verse eid="RUT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 4:3" />Lacen Boaj owaco ki dano ma en lalakoni ni, “Naomi, madong odwogo cen nia ki i lobo Moab, tye kacato but dul lobo mo mayam pa ominwa Elimelek. <verse eid="RUT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 4:4" />Pimeno omiyo atamo ni kong atiti, kun awaco ni, in i wil ki inyim jo man ma gibedo kany, ki inyim ludongowani. Kace ibikokone, ci koki; ento ka pe, ci tita wek ange, pien in aye lakok ma okwongo, an aye lalub kori.” Ci en ogamo ni, “An abikokone.” <verse eid="RUT 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 4:5" />Boaj dok owace ni, “Inino ma i wilo iye dul lobo meno ki bot Naomi, nongo in i wilo wa ki Ruth ma anyira Moab bene, ma dako pa latoni, pi dwoko nying lato ikom ginaleyane.” <verse eid="RUT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 4:6" />Ma omiyo lalako ni owaco ni, “An pe atwero kokone pira, miyo abalo ginaleyana woko. In ikoki; dong ajalo twerona me kokone boti, pien an pe atwero kokone.”<verse eid="RUT 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 4:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 25:9">Nwo 25:9</ref>
      </char>
    </note>Man aye kit mayam con kitimo kwede i Icrael ikare me koko dul lobo, nyo ki loko ki dul lobo mukene: ci pi moko lok moni, con dano acel lunyu ware woko, ci miyo ki ngat mukene; meno aye yam obedo lok me caden i Icrael. <verse eid="RUT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 4:8" />Ka lalako dok owaco ki Boaj ni, “In aye i wil,” ci olunyu ware woko, <verse eid="RUT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 4:9" />ci Boaj owaco ki ludongo ki bot lwak ducu matye ni, “Wun aye wucaden ma moko ni atyeko wilo jami ducu mayam pa Elimelek, ki jami ducu mayam pa Kilion, ki jami ducu mayam pa Malon nia ki i cing Naomi. <verse eid="RUT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5-6">Nwo 25:5-6</ref></char></note>Ki Ruth anyira Moab bene mayam dako pa Malon dong atyeko warone woko wek obed dakona, pi dwoko nying lato ikom ginaleyane, wek nying lato pe kijwa woko ki ikin utmege, nyo ki i dog taun kama kinywalo iyeni. Tin wun aye wucaden.” <verse eid="RUT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 4:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 29:31">Aca 29:31</ref></char></note>Ci jo ducu mayam onongo gitye i dog gang kacel ki ludongo guwaco ni, “Wan aye lucaden. Rwot omii dako meno ma bino i odini obed macalo Lakeri ki Lea, ma gin aryo ducu gutingo wi ot pa Icrael malo. Myero ibed matek i Eprata, nyingi bene oywek i Beterekem, <verse eid="RUT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 38:27-30">Aca 38:27-30</ref></char></note>odi bene obed rom ki ot pa Perej mayam Tamar onywalo ki Juda, pi lutino ma Rwot bimiyo ki in ma a ki i latin dakoni.”<verse eid="RUT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tekwaro pa Daudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 4:13" />Kitmeno Boaj otero Ruth, odoko dakone ci obedo kwede, ci Rwot omiyo ogamo ic, onywalo latin laco. <verse eid="RUT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 4:14" />Ci mon wade guwaco ki Naomi ni, “Dong kipwo Rwot ma pe oweko ibedo labongo wat macok kwedi tin. Wek nying latin man oywek i lobo Icrael. <verse eid="RUT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 4:15" />En biroco kwoni odoco, dok bigwoko in ka i tii; pien ciwodi ma mari, ma pire teki makato awobe abironi, en aye onywale.” <verse eid="RUT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 4:16" />Ci Naomi otingo latini, opyelo ikore, ci odoko lapidine. <verse eid="RUT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 4:17" />Mon wadine aye gucako nyinge, kun giwaco ni, “Kinywalo ki Naomi latin laco.” Ma gucako nyinge ni Obed; en aye obedo won Yece, ma won Daudi.<verse eid="RUT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 4:18" />Man aye likwayo pa Perej: Perej onywalo Kejeron, <verse eid="RUT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 4:19" />Kejeron onywalo Ram, Ram onywalo Aminadab, <verse eid="RUT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 4:20" />Aminadab onywalo Nakucon, Nakucon onywalo Calmon, <verse eid="RUT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 4:21" />Calmon onywalo Boaj, Boaj onywalo Obed, <verse eid="RUT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 4:22" />Obed onywalo Yece, ci Yece onywalo Daudi.<verse eid="RUT 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 4" />
</usx>